        "id": 1967833
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-09-06T16:19:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was going to suggest if we could make them optional and allocate them on demand, just before the submission that\u0027d require an emulated signal operation, but I understand Vulkan\u0027s \u0027externally synchronized\u0027 requirement for the fences on submissions is established manually with these objects when used over virtio. That could make things more performant, and also could be easier to track when any emulation/delay is actually needed.",
      "parentUuid": "636699ec_aed555d2",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 293,
        "startChar": 4,
